			subtitle: "Boon Paths are rare forms of magic brought into the world by forces beyond the Four Domains. Unlike the Ten True Paths, they cannot be reached through Mage Cores or Mage Potions. A Boon Path is gained by offering certain items—an exchange made for unknown power. You may only ever follow one of these Paths at a time, but you are free to shift your allegiance by changing the offering you make."
